  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;be the focal chord of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>64</mn><mi>x</mi></math>, which is tangent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>.&nbsp;Then, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is equal to______",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "34",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>64</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Coordinates of focus of parabola is : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math> is focal chord, hence</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math> is tangent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>, therefore</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>Then,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mfrac><mn>17</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>34</mn></math></p>",
